 os casos.", "t_start": 27.48, "t_end": 28.7, "t_avail": 29.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 9}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Uma decidência junta. Eu só que -", "t_start": 29.740000000000002, "t_end": 31.360000000000003, "t_avail": 31.400000000000002, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 10}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Eu", "t_start": 31.400000000000002, "t_end": 31.400000000000002, "t_avail": 32.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 11}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "acredito nisso agora porque", "t_start": 31.400000000000002, "t_end": 32.46, "t_avail": 33.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 11}, {"kind": "final", "text": "há evidências apoiando.", "t_start": 32.440000000000005, "t_end": 33.88, "t_avail": 34.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 11}, {"kind": "final", "text": "a maioria dos casos, mas se isso", "t_start": 34.2, "t_end": 35.900000000000006, "t_avail": 36.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "final", "text": "fosse...", "t_start": 35.900000000000006, "t_end": 35.980000000000004, "t_avail": 36.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "verdadeiro", "t_start": 36.0, "t_end": 36.36, "t_avail": 37.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "para todos os casos.", "t_start": 36.36, "t_end": 37.04, "t_avail": 37.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Você seria,", "t_start": 37.26, "t_end": 37.64, "t_avail": 38.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "final", "text": "seria o amor um... posto 7", "t_start": 37.7, "t_end": 38.92, "t_avail": 39.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "da pena de", "t_start": 39.0, "t_end": 39.6, "t_avail": 40.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 14}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "morte", "t_start": 39.62, "t_end": 40.0, "t_avail": 40.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 14}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 41.2, "t_end": 41.2, "t_avail": 41.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "e 